OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent search for vulnerable
OL,4,Ateenager who is non-verbal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched an urgent search
OL,7,Ffor a vulnerable teenager from Glasgow
OL,8,Fwho is non-verbal.
OL,10,FHaroon Ali was last seen in the Royston
OL,11,Farea at about 08:15.
OL,13,FThe 16-year-old is described as being
OL,14,F6ft tall, with dark hair. When Haroon
OL,15,Fwas last seen he was wearing a white
OL,16,Fshirt, black trousers, black shoes and
OL,17,Fa black North Face jacket.
OL,19,FThere are extensive searches in the
OL,20,Farea and Police Scotland have asked
OL,21,Fmembers of the public to check garden
OL,22,Fsheds and outhouses.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
